<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 9.25 to 5,882.17.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 1.06 to 367.33, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 11 cents.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1,295 to 1,069.</p>
<p>Volume was 388,269,020, compared with 406,785,730 Friday.</p>
</text>
